| History                 = When [[Loki Laufeyson (Earth-201163)|Loki]] sent a [[Rock Trolls|Troll]] to wreak havoc on Earth, some heroes, including Iron Man, went to the place but were duped and started fighting each other until they realized the deception and teamed up as the [[Avengers (Earth-201163)|Avengers]] to fight the Trolls and Loki together. Later, at the sound of the alarm at [[Avengers Mansion]], Iron Man and the Avengers had to face [[Helmut Zemo (Earth-201163)|Baron Zemo]] and his Crimebots who had sprinkled the city with glue so that they could rob the city undisturbed. The Avengers defeated Zemo and his Crimebots, while Iron Man rid the city of glue by dissolving it with the heat of his jet boots.{{r|The Mighty Avengers: The Faces of Justice!}}

