* Stark's suits have been stolen by different Marvel characters: [[Francis Castle (Earth-616)|Punisher]],{{r|Punisher: War Zone Vol 3 5}} [[Remy LeBeau (Earth-616)|Gambit]],{{r|Gambit Vol 5 13}} [[Wade Wilson (Earth-616)|Deadpool]],{{r|Deadpool Vol 4 7}} [[Doreen Green (Earth-616)|Squirrel Girl]],{{r|Unbeatable Squirrel Girl Vol 1 2}} and [[Jessán Hoan (Earth-616)|Tyger Tiger]] (though she had seized It from black market arms dealers).{{r|All-New Wolverine Vol 1 18}}
